{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟Copilot、智能體與平台業務執行副總裁查爾斯·拉曼納表示，隨着人工智能智能體日益普及，大量軟件和技術產品的「主要客户」將不再是人類，而是AI智能體。他認為，軟件的界面、接口和商業模式都必須為此做出調整，而工程師雖然寫代碼的時間減少，卻需要比以往更加深入地思考系統設計、驗證、測試和安全發佈等問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587760.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.196290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:48:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"5889a3cbcc5e3b0dc19c7f319e160a0cd379891d6af3c04a63091080e114d71a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}